  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote"/>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">ASC 740 considers the equity component of AFUDC a temporary difference for which deferred income taxes must be provided. The Respondent is required to record the deferred tax liability for AFUDC equity in Account282 with a corresponding regulatory asset. The regulatory asset is itself a temporary difference for which deferred income taxes are recognized and recorded in Account 283. This accounting is also outlined in FERCDocket AI93-5-000.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The Tuscarora Gas Transmission Company "Fuel and Line Loss Percentage" does not identify separate fuel and loss components.&#160; Therefore, all gas retained from shippers is reported as "Gas Received from Shippers as Compressor Station Fuel."</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Receipts represent the decreases in linepack.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Deliveries represent the increases in linepack and Gas Used for Other Operations.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Lines 9 through 29 are allocated to each rate type using a pro-rata allocation.&#160; The allocation is determined by dividing the Shipper Supplied Gas for each rate type by the total Shipper Supplied Gas for lines 2 through 6, and multiplying by the corresponding monthly totals for lines 9 through 29.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The basis for valuing the gas is the PG&amp;E, Malin Midpoint price from Platts Gas Daily with the flow date as of the last day of the month.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Respondent has a Commission Approved Transporter's Use Adjustment&#160; that tracks shipper supplied gas.&#160; The applicable excess or deficient balance is included in the next monthly retention calculation to collect deficiences or pass back excesses.</link:footnote>
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="f-246" xlink:href="#f-246"/>
